{"ID":"20240314092240-5ic503t","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092240-5ic503t","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092240-5ic503t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160618-53uxqvc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160656-ec7ch1v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3063,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422160656-ec7ch1v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:51,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:51\u0026#125;","title":"【肾气丸】（桂附八味丸）","type":"doc","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422160618-53uxqvc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-53uxqvc","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"问曰：妇人病。飮食如故，烦热不得卧，而反倚息者何也？师曰：此名转胞，不得溺也，以胞系了戾，故致此病，但"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当利小便则愈，肾气丸主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-myr3s3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-myr3s3w","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾气丸方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-lzlpyy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-lzlpyy3","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"亁地黄八两、山药山茱萸各四两、泽泻丹皮茯苓各三两、桂枝一两、附子一枚炮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-w0dsx9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-w0dsx9a","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右八味，末之炼蜜和丸，梧子大，酒下十五丸，加至二十丸，日再服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-86m5py6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-86m5py6","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他有个学生问的张仲景啊，妇人病，吃东西，饮食都正常，但是“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"烦热不得卧，而反倚息者何也？"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，为什么这样？张仲景说，吃东西什么都正常，但是会有情绪很烦躁，小便不出来的这种情形呢，这就叫“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"转胞"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就是那个胎儿本身在子宫里面，或者子宫本身位置移动了，压迫到膀胱小便不出来了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胞系了戾，故致此病，但当理小便则愈"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那一般来说我们对妇科，妇科除了生小孩怀孕的时候压迫到那个膀胱里面小便不出来，如果你的子宫位置移动或者怎么样造成小便不出来，都是肾气丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-inv5cxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-inv5cxl","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个肾气丸诸位看，我们是八味药组成的肾气丸。第一个干地黄呢，一般来说我们用熟地，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"熟地八，淮山四，山茱萸四"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个选择熟地的原因是因为熟地颜色是黑的，同时呢黑的入血分，味道比较厚哦，所以这个入血分；那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"熟地呢，这个入血分入肾嘛，肾是黑色的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"淮山呢，颜色是白的，它能够健脾胃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以它是土，能够健脾；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"山茱萸呢入肝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，山茱萸味道很酸，山茱萸很好吃，拿起来吃味道像葡萄干一样，入肝，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以这三味药，一个在补肾，一个在补脾，一个在补肝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，比例上是 8:4:4:3，...我们后面还有三味药，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"丹皮，茯苓，泽泻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那丹皮、泽泻、茯苓，这些都是3，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"比例上是 3"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以后面呢我们加了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝1、炮附子1"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以这个比例呢绝对不是八味药等量。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-s030pxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-s030pxm","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你如果跑到买明通或者我们台湾的很多 GMP 药厂啊，桂附八味丸是等量的，那个不行，不堪用的，要改掉。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这八味呢是三个补三个泻，丹皮泻肝脏，茯苓泻脾脏，泽泻泻肾脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，三个是补的（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"熟地、淮山、山茱萸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），三个是泻的（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"泽泻、茯苓、丹皮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），刚好是针对这三个脏。然后加桂枝，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝呢加强心脏的力量，同时让心脏的热进入小肠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，到了小肠后我们用附子来把它固在小肠里面，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炮附子是固下焦阳用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。记得我的话，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"强心的时候就要靠桂枝或者生附"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，桂枝力量不够的时候我们要靠生附。但是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"为什么要加炮附子？就是怕阳往外走"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你好不容易把阳建立起来了，结果你没有去固阳，阳又散失掉，就这意思。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-qa94dne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-qa94dne","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，我们休息一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-42091vp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-42091vp","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个金匮肾气丸，我们也叫桂附八味丸，这个呢实际上它是一个补泻兼顾的一个药，所以临床上你在使用的时候，老师我们有六味地黄丸，还有桂附八味丸，因为你有肉桂跟附子在里面，药性能让下焦比较热。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果病人有便秘的情形，你用六味地黄丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"那吃六味地黄丸很好玩，如果病人本身有便秘，吃了一段时间以后，就变成大便正常了。如果你是便秘的，开错药了，开成桂附八味丸，病人的便秘就会更加严重一点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以说这个唯一的差异就是便秘。但是如果有一个太太呢有一点下利，同时有虚烦的现象的时候...有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"转胞"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，小便不顺。那你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只要听太太小姐们说小便不是很顺利，都是可以使用桂附八味丸的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那这个处方呢，效果很快，如果只是针对小便，那吃下去药就到了。一般来说，我们吃的时候三十乘二，就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"早晚饭前各三十颗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个是丸剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-hplxu3v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-hplxu3v","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那平常没事呢就可以吃，那老师吃到什么时候？正常的人呢，身体头面是冷的，手脚是温热的，所以你没有病的时候，平常本来就没有病这个肾气丸也是治虚劳用的，那身体里会烦躁啊，手脚是冰冷的啊，那你都可以吃这个肾气丸，注意就是有下利...如果你有一天一两次大便比较稀的时候，这是标准的肾气丸证，赶快去吃。那中医呢，在这个过去经方的观念里认为，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"六味地黄丸和桂附八味丸都是所谓长寿，让吃的人会长寿的药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个肾气丸处方，诸位看，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"地黄是八，山药、山茱萸四，泽泻、丹皮、茯苓三，所以是补泻兼顾的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一般来说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"补会比较多一点，泻会比较少一点"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那这是一个养的一个方子。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-1wi3wbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-1wi3wbl","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们平常没有病的时候，我们要养！所谓养是什么意思，你如果将来当医生，病人找你去减肥，结果病人一看你比他还胖，那找你减肥找错人了嘛。那所以要瘦一点。那那个老美的减肥的医生都是胖子，你想想看还有人找他去减肥，那个人都超级胖。每次病人来看到我，说我要跟你一样。好，想跟我一样你要学我。我们"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一个人的胖瘦是心脏在决定"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你如果心脏有问题，就算你吃素照样胖，你如果心脏很好，你吃荤的照样瘦。所以真正控制我们身体体重的是心脏。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂附八味丸，里面有附子、桂枝就是强他的心脏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，桂枝呢强他的心脏，把心脏的血往往下导，导到小肠里面来，炮附子来固他的心脏。所以说我们平常要保持心脏功能很好，当你在有压力的时候，我们每个人都有压力，比如说我们今天讲的是人纪最后一堂课，两年半的时间，这两年半呢我坐在书房里面，想运动想练易筋经都没办法练，所以从明天开始我要把体力练好，我要开始练功夫，因为将来地纪要用，地纪的话体力要很好。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-vfrww85","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-vfrww85","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用什么方法在不动的情况下还是继续瘦？这就是我的秘诀，第一个，心情要保持很开朗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一旦家庭里有纠纷的时候，逃走，你坐在那里无济于事嘛，逃走！那如果逃走更坏，就躲在墙角，假装看不到，对啊！她就不好意思嘛，所以心情要保持开朗，要常常保持幽默的感想。所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"美国现在的长寿，过去的案例，所有世界上长寿的人都是瘦子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以我们有一句话就出来了：从未见过长寿的胖子，所以美国很有名的街星（Jazz，爵士乐），像 GerogeBenson，还有 PopHope，都是瘦子，都超过一百岁。那你要看到超过一百岁的人，你当然要相信他了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你怎么会相信一个只能平均活了 54 岁寿命的医生呢？现在美国的西医平均寿命 54岁，所以你看差多少？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你的医学吃西药吃了半天，你一辈子宣扬西药是对的，结果你平均寿命54 岁。还越吃越胖，为什么？因为西药伤到心脏。那我从来不吃西药的，从小我妈拿药片给我，就吞不下去，吞大药片含成小药片，还在嘴巴里面。气的我妈妈说，好了，算了，给你吃中药，汤药总可以吧，诶可以。就是这样天生的（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"讨厌西药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），那时候被打那个疫苗，没办法，因为不懂嘛，否则我疫苗都不会打。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-8zoevyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-8zoevyy","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240416141330-b1wv27d.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-d5hyzw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-d5hyzw0","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这就是心情很好..."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"天气热的时候，我们要保冷，这个保冷并不是说你要吹冷气，不是哦，而是心脏要强一定要用冷而不是热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以张仲景说：火邪火邪，对不对？不是说要靠近火，而是要保冷。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"平常你能够洗冷水澡就洗冷水澡"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。如果说实在是......哎呀，老师，那个冷水澡实在是很痛苦，没有关系，用冷水去冲脚，冲脚之前呢，你的脚即使是冰的都没有关系。冲他个两分钟三分钟，用冷水冲，冬天也是一样。冲了一两分钟以后，你会感觉这个水是热的，这就是在强你的心脏。所以强心的动作呢，他不是说一定要这个吃一副药，而是日积月累下来的。好，所以说，大家能够"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"保持心脏功能很强，你当然会瘦掉，为什么会瘦掉？心和小肠是表里的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，当你的心火进入小肠以后，像我们抽烟抽很多，为什么会瘦掉？因为我们用药皂荚，皂荚丸或者我们用苦参配在汤剂里面，加黄芩黄连呐这些药，把肺里面清掉，清掉以后加一些五味子，麦门冬啊把津液补回去，意思就是说把汽车水箱修理好。然后利用心脏到小肠的温度..."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把小肠温度增加以后，腹部周围的小肠的火很盛的时候，周围的脂肪就会燃烧掉啊"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以中年妇女你如果说小腹微凸，老师我穿那种比基尼不好意思啊，突出来看着不好，又不是大黄甘遂汤证对不对，那我们除了防己黄芪汤可以用之外，平常你就要保持小肠的火是热的。那老师，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我怎么知道小肠火是热的？脚是热的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-cjqjzik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-cjqjzik","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金匱肾气丸就是能够让大家脚热的一种药，如果你吃这个药，越吃脚越冷，你吃错药了。好，不管你是中药西药都没有关系，任何药吃下去，能让您脚是热的，我就赞成。好，我们《人纪》结束之前，大家要有一个观念，我一辈子在想的事情就是，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"任何事、任何药物、任何生活习惯，只要对病人有利，我们就应该发扬，去做"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以今天如果你阿司匹林真的对病人有效，我一定会支持阿司匹林，可是问题是我看到的所有的美国人吃阿司匹林没有一个是好的，这就是我反对的原因，当反对的时候不是为了我个人，而是为了大家的健康。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-t81wi1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-t81wi1o","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以大家以后知道这种药有没有效吃一两天就知道了，不用吃一个月。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160618-erg5ihh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160618-erg5ihh","updated":"20240422160618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，诸位看这个条辩，像这种药..."}]},{"ID":"20240422160620-8qeg0c0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160620-8qeg0c0"}},{"ID":"20240422160633-n5ys6x9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422160633-n5ys6x9","updated":"20240422160633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男子消渴，小便反多，以饮一斗，小便亦一斗，肾气丸主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160633-qt5fvsm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160633-qt5fvsm","updated":"20240422160633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有一种消渴呢，男子消渴，小便多，喝一杯水就小便一杯水，肾气丸主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160633-qptehd3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160633-qptehd3","updated":"20240422160633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们在经方里面呢，我们把消渴分三，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"上消"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢，就是口渴，肺里面的津液不够了，上焦津液不够了，口非常的渴，渴饮千杯不能止渴，这个就是我们讲的人参白虎汤证，白虎汤呢，石膏来去热，来补足津液，人参呢，来把肠胃的津液补足；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"中消"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢，哦，他张仲景没有处方，我出了方，待会儿我跟诸位介绍；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"下消现在讲的就是这个地方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个是肾气丸。那下消看起来跟上消都是一样，小便多，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"喝一斗水小便一斗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，哦，这里是肾气丸。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"看起来跟上消一样，实际上这里的消讲的是性功能没有了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，就是不举。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160633-18t8kxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160633-18t8kxy","updated":"20240422160633"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肾气丸呢，后面我们会介绍，在妇科里面会介绍，就是六味地黄丸加上桂附哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160645-zl5arkx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160645-zl5arkx"}},{"ID":"20240422160645-8nnbhsd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422160645-8nnbhsd","updated":"20240422160645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"夫短气有微饮，当从小便去之，苓桂术甘汤主之。肾气丸亦主之"}]},{"ID":"20240422160645-zvw3vns","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160645-zvw3vns","updated":"20240422160645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后边呢，短气有微饮者，当从小便去，也是苓桂术甘汤主之。那肾气丸也主，也可以治疗他。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160645-kaas6rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160645-kaas6rj","updated":"20240422160645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"金匮肾气丸就是我们的六味地黄丸，加上肉桂，和附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那这种身上有点微饮，桂附本身就是温阳的药，阳一热起来，水就排掉了，所以肾气丸也可以。这里呢，因为肾气丸的方子，我们在妇人篇杂症时我们会介绍到，这里暂时不谈肾气丸，介绍到妇科的时候，我们再跟诸位详细介绍桂附八味丸的方义。所以，苓桂术甘汤非常好用。这种昏眩呢，像你晕车晕船也可以用。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160645-cbyucyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160645-cbyucyo","updated":"20240422160645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果说苓桂术甘汤吃下去以后，病人还是恶心想吐，苓桂术甘汤跟五苓散，五苓散也可以治疗晕眩呕吐，唯一的差异在哪里呢，五苓散是病人渴，小便不利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以我们是利水用的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160645-lsoeew8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160645-lsoeew8","updated":"20240422160645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如说有个人哪，中暑，本来我们就流汗流得很凶，可是他这个人呢，本来毛孔就很小，很细小。可能一般人来说毛孔，你们注意看啊？所以会算命不错的，他这个八字啊，就农历的十二月和一月，二月，就是冬天的时候出生的，出生的冬天不单单是冬天，也不在台湾，出生在黑龙江或是北美或是加拿大，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"很冷的地方又在冬天生，这种人生下来，天生毛孔就很小"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。好了，有一天到南方来啊，到佛罗里达来玩，结果，他突然（SUNJUST？）太阳浴，太阳很大，一照射，很热，这水跑到皮肤表面上，又没有流汗出来。跑到皮肤表面上以后，他里面很热，水又回不了头停在那个皮肤表面上面，这个时候，他小便也不出来，因为水在表啊，这个水在上面，小便就不利，但中焦肠胃里面没有水，变得很口渴。口渴啊，那小便又不利，照理说你口渴，你喝水去，是不是小便就出来了？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"但他口渴，小便又不利，这是五苓散证"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以如果说病人不适合发表药，比如说个看这个病人，开了麻黄，桂枝下去，天啦，一滴汗都不出，好，你就记得这个家伙，下次你就用小便解，同样的，发烧感冒开五苓散给他。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160645-mbcjehh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160645-mbcjehh","updated":"20240422160645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他不是病哦，因为他天生就这个样子吗，你不能跟他说，你下次生在南方，对不对？他已经生下来了哦，只是毛孔天生比较小，这时我们会用到五苓散。所以用五苓散的时候，我们有水肿啊，小便不利啊等症状，这个苓桂术甘汤没有，就是昏眩好，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"昏眩头疼同时胸胁支满，会感觉到胸肋这边很胀满"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160645-mb4l9z4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160645-mb4l9z4","updated":"20240422160645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这胸胁就是我们刚才讲的，这个是基座，上面是平衡的地方，平衡点的地方。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160655-1rgx38k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160655-1rgx38k"}},{"ID":"20240422160656-ynmvr94","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-ynmvr94","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虚劳腰痛，少腹拘急，小便不利者，八味肾气丸主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-n1dpinh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-n1dpinh","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"八味肾气丸方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-6bcpyyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-6bcpyyo","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"干地黄八两\t山药山茱萸各四两\t泽泻丹皮茯苓各三两\t桂枝一两\t附子一枚炮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-8mvhrcd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-8mvhrcd","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右八味，末之炼蜜和丸，梧子大，酒下十五丸，加至二十丸，日再服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-w20ns14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-w20ns14","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在我们介绍金匮里面很有名的一个处方，它的名字叫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"八味肾气丸，也称为金匮肾气丸，也叫做桂附八味丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。随便你怎么叫都没有关系，处方都是这个。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-0081v8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-0081v8e","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"使用的时机"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢？诸位看，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"都是虚劳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"嘛，虚劳就要滋补。这个虚劳呢有腰痛，哦，少腹拘急，然后小便不利者，八味肾气丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-mr788h9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-mr788h9","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上次我跟大家介绍过少腹拘急，这个你如果不讲清，不讲明白，实在是很难意会啊。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"男人的睾丸抽痛，女人的阴道抽痛、抽筋，就是少腹拘急"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果说你是腹痛，肚子痛，隐隐作痛，对不对，那就是小建中汤证嘛。刚才不是讲过吗，小建中汤白芍一加重，腹痛就没有了。那女人的那个月经来的痛，也是重用白芍，是不是也会好？那这里又来个少腹拘急干嘛？就是筋痛、抽痛的这个症状。为什么？这个因为肝呢......主筋，我们全身的筋呢是肝脏在管，肝主筋。那这个筋是络过我们的睾丸这边和女人的阴道那边，那当你虚劳的时候，筋没有......这个筋啊，没有营养来滋润它，因为虚劳嘛，这筋就很急，一急就会抽起来，所以筋急就是这个意思。所以，如果你光看这个。不会想到说那个男人的女人的都可以用，什么时候可以用。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-7rdlk5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-7rdlk5s","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那小便不利者，小便不利呢就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"频尿，也是小便不利，怎么一个小时上两次厕所，每次出来几滴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。或者是小便，这个排不出来哦，都是属于小便不利。或者是小便的欲望，小便有欲望啊，你会感觉出我要去小便，这是正常啊。那一天在那边都不去小便你也不对，为什么？因为意念没有了，那都是属于小便不利。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-11ushkf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-11ushkf","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个八味肾气丸呢，大家看它的处方，现在外面做的六味地黄丸跟那个金匮八味肾气丸，统统是什么样？你一拿去统统都是等量，可能明通、圣天堂或者什么 GMP 厂啊或者...我不晓得，但是我看到的都是等量。那过去呢没有 GMP 厂，你发现很多人他们药房都可以自己做药丸嘛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"都是等量"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"实际上不对的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你看，他叫做肾气丸、也叫做"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"八味地黄丸，是要重用地黄"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，地黄用8，你不一定8两。山药、山茱萸呢4，泽泻、丹皮、茯苓 3，桂枝炮附子1，那么你按照这个比例，你做 2 斤、3 斤、4 斤、5 斤都没关系，哦，这个八味呢把它弄成粉末以后跟蜜和在一起，哦，那酒下 15 丸，加至 20 丸。那这个丸多大呢？像梧桐子大。你们现在看到的药丸就像梧桐子那么大啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-2nnhds7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-2nnhds7","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个虚劳腰痛这个处方怎么来的？干地黄哦，一定是重用，这个是补肾，滋肾阴的，大家都知道。山药呢就是淮山，它是健脾的药，山茱萸呢，酸味入肝脏、补肝的啊。所以这三个补药在的时候，肾、肝、脾它统统补到，那泽泻呢，它能够清肾，把肾里面东西清出来，那茯苓呢，健脾，能够把脾脏里面的东西清出来，再来呢，这个丹皮呢，能够入肝脏，所以说它等于是三补三泻。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-9z4sulk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-9z4sulk","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"啊，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"真正好的处方，滋补的药是补泻兼顾，绝对不可以开纯补的药哦，纯补的药是西洋人搞出来的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，一片维他命 B12，那是纯补的药，纯补的药上去呢，就好像你拿油漆去涂一棵活生生的树，油漆涂死的木头可以呀，可以保久嘛。那你还是活到的啊，死掉的涂个油漆可以保久一点啊，对不对，还活到的，涂个油漆就要完蛋。所以是非常，西医自己嘴巴讲促进新陈代谢，就是新的换去旧的，做出来的东西却是百分之百纯补品，那都不对的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-i99ve70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-i99ve70","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个处方呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"平常就可以吃，吃的时候呢放一点点盐巴，因为咸味入肾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个盐巴放上去的时候不是说很多，而是像这样抓起来一点点，洒在水里面喝下去，那这个盐巴的目的就是把药带到肾脏里面去而已。所以桂附八味丸呢就是治疗虚劳腰痛使用的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-zqxtzui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-zqxtzui","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那如果说，当你在吃炮附子的时候，因为因为里面有附子......很热，病人呢，吃完药以后说：哎医生，我怎么吃你的药后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"开始便秘？你就可以把药改成六味地黄丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，把这个桂枝附子拿掉，前面六位就是六味地黄丸哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-n8pdohu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-n8pdohu","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以一般我在使用的时候怎么使用呢？我决定到底他是吃桂附还是吃六味呢，对不对？问他大便好不好，我"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一天 3、4 次，就是八味丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一天一次，六味丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。他就是虚劳的话，他大便会次数会比较多，拉肚子比较多。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂附八味丸因为里面有肉桂、附子，下去以后它就反而可以止利"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，里面茯苓啊可以把大肠里面的津液从小便利出来。所以平常有下利的人呢可以吃桂附八味丸。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"但是我讲的下利是寒利，你不要给热利用来治痢哦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，老师，我大便便脓血，嘴巴燥渴，你给他吃桂附八味丸，他更热。所以不能弄错哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-jmdq465","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-jmdq465","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那肾气旺的时候，老师你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怎么知道他肾气很旺？"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这不讲肾气嘛，看头发，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"头发呢有发油，光光亮亮的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，你如果头发是染的，一涂上去看都是黑的但是暗暗的没有光，所以如果肾气很旺的头发就很亮。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-1zjlzuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-1zjlzuy","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我治过一个肾气旺到什么程度的，一个 17 岁的小姐，她进来，妈妈带她来，我问：你什么问题？她说：我一天要洗好几次头，不洗头的话，这个如果 3 个小时不洗头，我站在那边，风吹过来头发都不动的，太多油了，哦，到这种程度啊。那个真的蓬起来哦，里面那个油都是身上发出来的，才 17 岁哦，那怎么办呢？她不是病呀，她肾气太旺呀，怎么办？对不对，我还是可以帮她解决，这时候你要想办法如何去设计一个处方，因为她"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肾气太旺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"三黄泻心汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"嘛，对不对，我们经方的观念就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用寒泻来撤热"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以三黄泻心汤，一下去，跑起来头发就在飘了。不然的话，你一跑起来头发都不动，很奇怪，对不对。如果风吹起来头发都不动，看起来就很特别的哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422160656-ec7ch1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422160656-ec7ch1v","updated":"20240422160656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以以后呢，诸位呢，你什么病都会遇到，对不对？有时候你会遇到你想都没想过的病，哦，可是原则是一样的哦。"}]}]}